	(text "Source / changes: Codex custom interface; Molex 467651001 SD-46765-001 sheets 1-2:\nhttps://www.molex.com/content/dam/molex/molex-dot-com/products/automated/en-us/salesdrawingpdf/467/46765/467651001_sd.pdf?inline=\nXEM connector pin list: https://pins.opalkelly.com/pin_list/XEM8310\nJ611 3/5 to MGT_RXP1_224/MGT_RXN1_224; 12/14 to B64_L2P/B64_L2N.\nU802 TI TPD4E02B04 SLVSD85B Rev B secs. 5, 6.6, 8.2 and 10:\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tpd4e02b04.pdf\nU IO1/2/3/4 = HDMI 3/5/12/14; flow-through pads 10/9/7/6 tied to IO1/2/3/4\n(SLVSD85B p3 pin table, straight-through routing); both GND pins to DGND.\nDirect shell bond assumes a common-ground bench system.\nConnector, cable, SI, ESD layout/strike and enclosure need verification." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 449.04 905.85 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0fd8e891-5ca1-4ed0-a114-428f09924fef"))
	
	(text "Source / changes: Codex custom interface; Molex 467651001 SD-46765-001 sheets 1-2:\nhttps://www.molex.com/content/dam/molex/molex-dot-com/products/automated/en-us/salesdrawingpdf/467/46765/467651001_sd.pdf?inline=\nXEM connector pin list: https://pins.opalkelly.com/pin_list/XEM8310\nJ616 3/5 to MGT_RXP2_226/MGT_RXN2_226; 12/14 to B64_L7P/B64_L7N.\nU807 TI TPD4E02B04 SLVSD85B Rev B secs. 5, 6.6, 8.2 and 10:\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tpd4e02b04.pdf\nU IO1/2/3/4 = HDMI 3/5/12/14; flow-through pads 10/9/7/6 tied to IO1/2/3/4\n(SLVSD85B p3 pin table, straight-through routing); both GND pins to DGND.\nDirect shell bond assumes a common-ground bench system.\nConnector, cable, SI, ESD layout/strike and enclosure need verification." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 734.79 1121.75 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "17b8839c-e044-448c-bcb4-4a80f2e4e8bd"))
