(rectangle (start 1543 34.37) (end 2020 241.37) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "117c1fdf-9ab6-4bbf-b327-1c4427dfb9a3"))
(text "PCIe x4 — BRK8310 reference circuit" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 1546 36.37 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5b071108-7166-48ed-ade3-72c630c74769"))
(rectangle (start 1543 247.37) (end 2020 301.37) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "efffea4b-6ee3-4e32-8a4f-b71152526b01"))
(text "Function: Connects PCIe x4 data and 100 MHz reference clock, with reset, SMBus and WAKE#. Host slot 12 V is isolated from the board 12 V input." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 1546 250.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0e92d84-fe05-4097-af51-6c970265ef1c"))
(text "Source / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8310-A01 schematic, p. 2, 2022-05-19: https://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/442/download?category_id=3\nAdapted from x8 to x4: fit R28 = 0 ohm; omit R29 and unused lanes 4–7 and C21–C26/C29–C30. R2/R7 and R9–R11 retained.\nUnused options R1/R8, R16/R17 and R27 are omitted.\nHost +12 V goes only to TP20. Host 3.3 V and AUX power the original sideband circuitry; they do not feed the main 12 V input.\nPCA9306 Rev O, Fig. 8-1, section 10: https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/pca9306.pdf ; SN74AXC1T45 Rev E: https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/sn74axc1t45.pdf\nAP22653 DS41186 Rev 5-2, sections 7–9: https://www.diodes.com/datasheet/download/AP22652_AP22653_AP22652A_AP22653A.pdf\nQ1 Si1922EDH dual FET, product datasheet: https://www.vishay.com/en/product/67192/\nWorking target: VIO1 = 1.5 V; set in XEM before testing and verify all Bank 64 I/O. Factory default 1.0 V is below PCA9306 range: https://docs.opalkelly.com/xem8310/device-settings/\nERC power flags at U2/U6 VREF2 represent their R13/R23 200k resistor-fed bias, not independent regulators. Confirm bias and startup.\nPCIe/HDMI combined Vivado design, clock, VIO1 choice, host sequencing and signal integrity remain to be verified." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 1546 256.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.55 1.55)) (justify left top)) (uuid "07163a5d-0682-4f94-ab24-82be6d990939"))

(rectangle (start 15 27) (end 560 226) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "c8435a04-8503-4611-8be8-cff9e827efad"))
(rectangle (start 17 228) (end 558 245) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "4770b85a-4381-46f8-a1e9-e7a8853355c8"))
(text "Function: XEM8310 connectors provide the board power, FPGA I/O, JTAG and GT connections; J4 is the 12 V input and MH1-MH4 mount the module." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 230 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "589d7cf6-cbaf-4e45-aa87-2551be0c6ed9"))
(text "Source / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8310-A01 p.1 (2022-05-19): https://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/442/download?category_id=3 ; Codex assigned the custom HDMI and x4 nets. VIO1 target is 1.5 V; program and verify it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 236 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2c691b21-e878-4f95-b2b9-f857a982f8fb"))
